261:             "harmony_adapted": {"type": "boolean", "description": "SCRIPT-stamped (scripts/harmony_adapted.js): true if this package already has an official HarmonyOS PC build in the OpenHarmony PC mirror (an *-ohos_*.whl etc.). Consumed by dim 9 (already-adapted dep ⇒ not a blocker). Do NOT set by hand."},
262:             "harmony_adapted_source": {"type": ["string", "null"], "description": "SCRIPT-stamped: which OpenHarmony PC mirror provides the adapted build."}}}},
